{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>We will build folds for our cattle here.</b> They were more protective of their property than of their sons and daughters, for they put their cattle before their little ones. Moses said to them: \"Not so — make the main thing main and the secondary thing secondary. Build cities for your little ones first, and afterward folds for your sheep\" (Tanchuma)."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:13:33.230154391Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}